{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["YHWH our Elohim, YHWH one — YHWH alone is our Elohim, and we have no other god with Him. So too in Chronicles: ״ואנחנו ה׳ אלהינו ולא עזבנוהו״ — that is, with you are golden calves, but we — YHWH is our Elohim, and we have not abandoned Him like the house of Jeroboam, which you worship." "YHWH one — to Him alone shall we worship, and we shall not add to worship with Him any other god, even for casting spells, as I explained above."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:38:23.898275433Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}